    <item>
      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>The endless hush sleeps The Arena in spectral light. 15 figures gracing this ground. Atlas Pathforge, a thoughtful explorer, pauses thoughtfully not far away. The rain patters, light and soothing. A stark frost hangs in the air.</description>
